{"id":1188,"root":"قحم","bw":"qHm","tr":"q-ḥ-m","found":true,"html":"<div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\">  <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قحم نَفْسَهُ فِى الأُمُورِ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> and <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فيها</span> </span> ↓ <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقحمّ</span> and ↓ <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اقتحم</span> <em>He entered into affairs without consideration.</em> (A.) </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\">  <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تَقَحَّمَ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> <em>He experienced dearth, drought,</em> or <em>sterility.</em> See an ex. voce <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تَبِعَةٌ</span>. ― -b2- <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تَقَحَّمَ فِى</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأَمْرِ بِلاَ رَوِيَّةٍ</span> [<em>He plunged,</em> or <em>rushed, into the affair without consideration</em>]. (K, * TA in art. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علط</span>.) See 1. ― -b3- <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تَقَحَّمَ</span>: see <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تَدَلَّثَ</span>. </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\">  <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اِقْتَحَمَ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span>. See 1. ― -b2- Said of a young camel: see voce <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بُلَعٌ</span>. ― -b3- <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اِقْتَحَمَ الغَمَراَتِ</span>: see 1 in art. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خوض</span>. And <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اقتحم العَقَبَةَ</span>: see <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عَقَبَةٌ</span>. </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قَحْمَةٌ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span>, like <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قَحْبَةٌ</span>, <em>An old woman.</em> See <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قَحْبٌ</span>. </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مُقْحَمٌ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> <em>Redundant; pleonastic; foisted in:</em> applied to a word and to a letter. ― -b2- <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حَرْفٌ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَقْحَمَةٌ</span> <em>A letter inserted without reason.</em> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مُقْحَمَةٌ</span> is also applied in like manner to a word. [In a copy of the S, in art. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بهت</span>, I find it written <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مُقْحِمَةٌ</span>]: <em>i. q.</em> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زَايءِدَةٌ</span>. (TA in art. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بهت</span>.) </div>","pages":null,"shownPages":null,"chars":1772,"entries":5,"shownEntries":5,"truncated":false,"match":"direct","key":"qHm"}